  "description": "Nalix.Network is the high-performance networking runtime for the Nalix ecosystem. It provides TCP and UDP listeners, connection management, packet dispatch, protocol lifecycle orchestration, middleware integration, and adaptive throttling for building scalable distributed services.\n\nDesigned for latency-sensitive workloads, it emphasizes efficient I/O, predictable concurrency, observability, and secure transport behavior so applications can process real-time traffic reliably under sustained load.",
