  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- Expanded ConnectionHub observability with configurable shard telemetry, anonymous queue depth metrics, and capacity-related runtime hooks.\n- Improved packet dispatch diagnostics with clearer loop, semaphore, and middleware instrumentation reporting.\n- Hardened UDP listener authentication with timestamp validation, Poly1305-based integrity checks, and replay-guard protections.\n- Added adaptive throttling primitives including ConnectionLimiter, TokenBucketLimiter, and PolicyRateLimiter.\n- Enhanced protocol lifecycle and metrics infrastructure for more reliable service orchestration.\n- Improved timing and scheduling components with high-resolution wheel-based coordination and synchronization helpers.\n- Continued performance, stability, and maintainability refinements across the networking stack.",
